  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a follow up of AtHV. The objective is to strengthen the main four PRCS&#x2019;s hospitals in the West Bank through enhanced WASH services, improving the quality of health care, patient care, and emergency response readiness, leading to a more resilient and efficient healthcare environment.</narrative>
